@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam ArrowColor black
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBorderColor transparent
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 ActivationBorderColor black
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
}
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n诊疗助理" as A
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n诊所负责人" as M
actor "供应商" as V
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n收费人员" as C
participant "<img:business-entity.png>\n牙科诊所管理系统" as S
A -> S : 提交材料补充需求
M -> S : 核对需求并确认供应商和采购明细
S --> M : 返回采购记录
M -> V : 确认采购及交付条件
V --> M : 确认供货安排
loop 每次到货
 V -> A : 交付材料及随货单据
 A -> A : 核对数量、批号、效期和实物
 A -> V : 告知合格、拒收及差异
 V --> A : 确认补货或退换处理
 A -> S : 登记验收明细、批次和拒收原因
 S -> S : 合格数量入库\n保留采购未到量及差异
 S --> A : 返回验收及库存结果
end
M -> S : 确认供货结算依据
C -> S : 查询应付、已付及差异
S --> C : 返回核对明细
C -> V : 核对货款并按约定付款
V --> C : 确认款项及凭据
C -> S : 登记实际付款及凭据
S --> C : 返回结算结果及余额
@enduml
